{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739340/extras/6fa0e0cbeeb6b230cf883bf6f67fa90c.avif?t=1753692609\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>&quot;What if your worst memories were part of a show\u2026 and you were the star?&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>The White Sea</i> is a first-person psychological horror game where nothing is what it seems. Set in an alternate version of the United States during the 1970s and 1980s, you play as <strong>Allison Graham</strong>, a journalist sent to investigate the mysterious abandoned town of White Sea, Montana.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Officially, the area was shut down after a series of disappearances in 1998. But Allison soon realizes her arrival was no coincidence: she has been selected as part of a twisted show designed to push her beyond her mental and emotional limits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Faced with distorted visions, psychological trials, and manipulated memories, she must find a way to escape\u2026 or become lost forever in a performance where every decision is watched, judged, and controlled.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fully immersive first-person psychological horror.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Exploration and limited-light mechanics: each flash reveals more than just walls... it reveals truth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fragmented, reactive narrative: uncover what\u2019s real and what\u2019s part of the show.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A personal journey into the past and mental manipulation, with emotional and symbolic weight.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The game includes:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739340/extras/Textos_Steam_Ingles.png?t=1753692609\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739340/extras/tws_steam_2-steam-crop-trim.end.3.88-fps.25-colors.gif?t=1753692609\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739340/extras/2025-05-29-11-59-49-steam-crop-trim.end.10.45-fps.25-colors.255.gif?t=1753692609\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739340/extras/720db32e75001fa508ee11ff23ab3874.poster.avif?t=1753692609\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739340/extras/720db32e75001fa508ee11ff23ab3874.webm?t=1753692609\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739340/extras/720db32e75001fa508ee11ff23ab3874.mp4?t=1753692609\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739340/extras/Textos_Steam_Ingles2.png?t=1753692609\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739340/extras/c45a232f72b5c32578a17bb6f512364e.poster.avif?t=1753692609\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739340/extras/c45a232f72b5c32578a17bb6f512364e.webm?t=1753692609\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739340/extras/c45a232f72b5c32578a17bb6f512364e.mp4?t=1753692609\" t